                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2ff2779-e3aa-3b3b-9408-aa4ee598051c",
                        "entry_id": "01fa36ff-e619-3ff7-936d-60a425ea71f6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "drukt een reden uit ondanks dewelke iets beweerd wordt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "onderschikkend"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27dba4bf-5003-4331-9b5b-b19402510970",
                                "sense_id": "e2ff2779-e3aa-3b3b-9408-aa4ee598051c",
                                "text": "Ofschoon een bescheiden budgetoverschrijding van de investering in de nieuwbouw onvermijdelijk is geweest, zijn de extra investeringen binnen de kaders van de meerjarenbegroting gebleven."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8315241b-1b44-43c0-a8a0-728591b33254",
                        "source_entry_id": "01fa36ff-e619-3ff7-936d-60a425ea71f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "e2ff2779-e3aa-3b3b-9408-aa4ee598051c",
                        "target_lang_word": "although",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "although",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                        "entry_id": "b3ddc799-961b-31e8-8efa-1cd2855466fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Though, even though, in spite of or despite the fact that: introducing a clause that expresses a concession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "986be2ce-2ef1-4ad5-a6cf-d473f444cd26",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "Although it was very muddy, the football game went on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b23c010-4e31-48a5-978d-deb831777ede",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "The patients, (al)though getting stronger, will not come off their medications."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44dda5db-ed69-4498-84ec-5ba62ec1bbea",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "Although proven, the accusation was ignored by the court."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ff4b368-d712-4ddf-b78a-1224c77872da",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "And moreover, much leſs can this poyſonouíneſs be produced from the Lead. For although it being long detained in the Body, and there reſolved, likeunto other Metals, (if it contract any ruſtineſs) it may poſſibly do hurt: but yet neverthleſs, that in this its moment any paſſage through the Body there ſhould be any poyſon imprinted by it upon the Body, this can no waybe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6aa4324-57b7-4410-a290-c9ec189a9345",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "Although the Celebrity was almost impervious to sarcasm, he was now beginning to exhibit visible signs of uneasiness, the consciousness dawning upon him that his eccentricity was not receiving the ovation it merited."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77c909ac-14ca-47c3-93e1-a41d35d6c427",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "The story struck the depressingly familiar note with which true stories ring in the tried ears of experienced policemen.[…]The second note, the high alarum, not so familiar and always important since it indicates the paramount sin in Man's private calendar, took most of them by surprise although they had been well prepared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03dee591-6a3d-433d-8907-9ab28d6061b8",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "With the north London derby to come at the weekend, Spurs boss Harry Redknapp opted to rest many of his key players, although he brought back Aaron Lennon after a month out through injury."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f6ea81e-2bec-4e39-9897-724f59d5b50b",
                                                "sense_id": "9e07aa28-a548-3757-a9d5-0e5a142ca1c5",
                                                "text": "Although there are dozens of different types of gems, among the best known and most important are diamond, ruby and sapphire, emerald and other gem forms of the mineral beryl, chrysoberyl, tanzanite, tsavorite, topaz and jade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ccea8b0-bfbc-3dce-a0bd-8729c20c702e",
                                        "entry_id": "b3ddc799-961b-31e8-8efa-1cd2855466fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "But, except."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87bdafaa-d673-4e27-a5da-35797e79fa8b",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccea8b0-bfbc-3dce-a0bd-8729c20c702e",
                                                "text": "It was difficult, although not as difficult as we had expected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbd28aa8-882d-4979-8aed-3f1023645e91",
                        "source_entry_id": "01fa36ff-e619-3ff7-936d-60a425ea71f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "e2ff2779-e3aa-3b3b-9408-aa4ee598051c",
                        "target_lang_word": "though",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "though",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28155c9c-18f5-34e9-b9d1-dcdf351116a4",
                                        "entry_id": "d31522d5-384d-3471-8e83-8a18fee4ad52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Despite that; however."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c527c9e7-55c4-4925-bdf2-f282c17c46e9",
                                                "sense_id": "28155c9c-18f5-34e9-b9d1-dcdf351116a4",
                                                "text": "I'm not paid to do all this paperwork for you. I will do it this once, though."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96afd7f8-2cf2-4c29-8624-a12b3372d926",
                                                "sense_id": "28155c9c-18f5-34e9-b9d1-dcdf351116a4",
                                                "text": "Whether modern, industrial man is less or more warlike than his hunter-gatherer ancestors is impossible to determine.[…]One thing that is true, though, is that murder rates have fallen over the centuries, as policing has spread and the routine carrying of weapons has diminished. Modern society may not have done anything about war. But peace is a lot more peaceful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ba30b45-621c-3c46-9e44-39648a2ebe28",
                                        "entry_id": "d31522d5-384d-3471-8e83-8a18fee4ad52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to intensify statements or questions; indeed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6ac1c31-bdeb-4239-ab72-e5c9ed0dd4d1",
                                                "sense_id": "0ba30b45-621c-3c46-9e44-39648a2ebe28",
                                                "text": "\"Man, it's hot in here.\" — \"Isn't it, though?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "though",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30ec0d02-c7ae-3e5c-96c0-2785df038d8d",
                                        "entry_id": "c99582cf-81d3-318c-bdfa-f6c66932b46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Despite the fact that; although."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2728458-80b2-4df2-b9c8-adc1224db3de",
                                                "sense_id": "30ec0d02-c7ae-3e5c-96c0-2785df038d8d",
                                                "text": "Though it is risky, it is worth taking the chance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e26ea481-a823-40d1-936d-ea214beda746",
                                                "sense_id": "30ec0d02-c7ae-3e5c-96c0-2785df038d8d",
                                                "text": "Astute businessman though he was, my brother was capable of extreme recklessness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2a70f06-ff7c-46ce-9792-08eaac1ffc7a",
                                                "sense_id": "30ec0d02-c7ae-3e5c-96c0-2785df038d8d",
                                                "text": "Actual perpetrators though they were, the criminals never admitted it in court."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4b5db06-615b-4c7a-b1de-1261aeb7932f",
                                                "sense_id": "30ec0d02-c7ae-3e5c-96c0-2785df038d8d",
                                                "text": "Orion hit a rabbit once; but though sore wounded it got to the bury, and, struggling in, the arrow caught the side of the hole and was drawn out. Indeed, a nail filed sharp is not of much avail as an arrowhead; you must have it barbed, and that was a little beyond our skill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2a3398d-4d8e-3f79-b805-d589073d7f2c",
                                        "entry_id": "c99582cf-81d3-318c-bdfa-f6c66932b46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "If, that, even if."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97316ed6-422d-4262-b186-d4814c83a3ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b2a3398d-4d8e-3f79-b805-d589073d7f2c",
                                                "text": "We shall be not sorry though the man die tonight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ded34491-6e63-43a4-8e46-3fb4731b97ed",
                                                "sense_id": "b2a3398d-4d8e-3f79-b805-d589073d7f2c",
                                                "text": "And hee said vnto him, If they heare not Moses and the Prophets, neither will they be perswaded, though one rose from the dead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd48f6c6-8e42-43ff-81ed-a7c6e3d4c9cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b2a3398d-4d8e-3f79-b805-d589073d7f2c",
                                                "text": "\"Though we called your friend from his bed this night, he could not speak for you, / \"For the race is run by one and one and never by two and two.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3521baf-d30c-4add-9f2e-cad38a2d3a2a",
                                                "sense_id": "b2a3398d-4d8e-3f79-b805-d589073d7f2c",
                                                "text": "Walk on through the wind, / Walk on through the rain, / Though your dreams be tossed and blown."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "though",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6287f4a9-b49a-312f-a489-810f0b7cf639",
